# Source of truth, kept local. Contains personal health data and must never be published.
SPEC.md

# Full-app critique notes, kept local. Quote his real data: weights, meals, places.
docs/critique.md

# Product record for design work, kept local. Says what he uses the app for, where and when.
PRODUCT.md

# Transit's plan, kept local. Holds his home, work and other private places.
docs/transit-plan.md

# Claude Code config. A global ignore excludes .claude/, but the secret-blocking hook
# is enforcement and has to be versioned with the code it protects.
!.claude/
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/hooks/*.py
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/pr-plan.md
# The design skill downloads its own 20 MB binary on first run.
.claude/skills/*/scripts/bin/

